WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.088 --> 00:00:13.969
was buried under Viktor's ugly fabric.

2
00:00:13.989 --> 00:00:18.530
"Viktor designs fabulous clothes," she thought.

3
00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:21.031
"Maybe I do need a new costume."

4
00:00:22.072 --> 00:00:22.812
She shook her head.

5
00:00:22.832 --> 00:00:25.013
"No!" she told herself.

6
00:00:25.033 --> 00:00:26.354
"Fight it!"

7
00:00:27.594 --> 00:00:29.215
Roxy remembered Terrell's words.

8
00:00:29.815 --> 00:00:31.936
"Rocket Girl doesn't need a new costume!

9
00:00:32.564 --> 00:00:34.445
The one she has is perfect!"

10
00:00:34.465 --> 00:00:36.506
"Terrell was right!"

11
00:00:37.406 --> 00:00:39.247
Roxy jumped out from under the fabric.

12
00:00:41.748 --> 00:00:42.568
Viktor was gone.

13
00:00:42.588 --> 00:00:47.190
"Viktor must be at the fashion show," Roxy said.

14
00:00:48.431 --> 00:00:48.971
She gulped.

15
00:00:49.951 --> 00:00:51.052
"My friends are there!"

16
00:00:53.373 --> 00:00:54.573
Roxy arrived at the show.

17
00:00:55.854 --> 00:00:57.134
People ran and screamed.

18
00:00:57.154 --> 00:00:59.955
"Mannequins!" a man shouted.

19
00:00:59.975 --> 00:01:01.656
"Run for your lives!"

20
00:01:03.188 --> 00:01:04.768
Mannequins walked along the runway.

21
00:01:05.309 --> 00:01:06.749
Their clothes were ugly.

22
00:01:07.409 --> 00:01:09.010
Some of the clothes didn't even fit well.

23
00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:11.990
One mannequin threw an ugly sweater.

24
00:01:12.851 --> 00:01:14.231
It landed on a woman's shoulder.

25
00:01:15.051 --> 00:01:18.112
Suddenly the woman's eyes went blank.

26
00:01:18.132 --> 00:01:18.852
"I love this!

27
00:01:19.492 --> 00:01:22.813
From now on, I will only wear Viktor Velour's clothes!"

28
00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:25.594
The other mannequins threw clothes at people too.

29
00:01:26.374 --> 00:01:28.735
The clothes quickly controlled anyone they touched.

30
00:01:31.436 --> 00:01:32.896
A jacket landed on Jack's head.

31
00:01:34.156 --> 00:01:36.558
"I love Viktor Velour's clothes!"

32
00:01:36.578 --> 00:01:39.280
"I must stop this!"

33
00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:42.182
Roxy saw Viktor peeking from behind a curtain.

34
00:01:43.763 --> 00:01:45.024
She flew toward the villain.

35
00:01:47.225 --> 00:01:48.146
"Oh no!"

36
00:01:48.966 --> 00:01:49.847
Viktor looked around.

37
00:01:49.867 --> 00:01:52.228
"Mannequins!" he shouted.

38
00:01:52.248 --> 00:01:53.789
"Protect me!"

39
00:01:55.551 --> 00:02:02.856
The mannequins quickly surrounded Viktor.

40
00:02:02.876 --> 00:02:04.597
Roxy felt plastic hands grab her.

41
00:02:07.797 --> 00:02:09.118
Roxy punched and kicked.

42
00:02:11.298 --> 00:02:12.639
Mannequins flew all over.

43
00:02:13.799 --> 00:02:16.340
Soon all of the mannequins lay broken on the floor.

44
00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:18.440
Viktor took a deep breath.

45
00:02:19.260 --> 00:02:22.461
"Rocket Girl, I'm a fashion designer.

46
00:02:23.161 --> 00:02:24.442
I don't like to fight.

47
00:02:25.202 --> 00:02:28.303
However He held an arm out toward Roxy.

48
00:02:28.323 --> 00:02:30.123
"You give me no choice!"

49
00:02:31.684 --> 00:02:32.624
Pow! Pow!

50
00:02:32.856 --> 00:02:35.458
Pow! Buttons shot from Viktor's sleeve.

51
00:02:36.539 --> 00:02:38.781
"Whoa!" Roxy dived out of the way.

52
00:02:39.321 --> 00:02:41.083
The buttons exploded against the wall.

53
00:02:43.124 --> 00:02:45.286
Roxy shot toward Viktor, dodging buttons.

54
00:02:45.867 --> 00:02:46.867
She slammed into him.

55
00:02:48.789 --> 00:02:50.871
"Oof!" Viktor stumbled backward.

56
00:02:51.231 --> 00:02:52.051
His hat fell off.

57
00:02:53.032 --> 00:02:55.054
Right away everyone's eyes returned to normal.

58
00:02:55.915 --> 00:02:56.855
A model screamed.

59
00:02:58.657 --> 00:03:02.380
"Why am I wearing this awful outfit?"

60
00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:05.321
"Where did I get this ugly jacket?"

61
00:03:05.701 --> 00:03:06.381
Jack asked.

62
00:03:07.242 --> 00:03:08.422
Sophie raised an eyebrow.

63
00:03:08.442 --> 00:03:10.523
"I have no idea."

64
00:03:10.543 --> 00:03:14.765
"Aha! The hat controls the fabric!"

65
00:03:15.745 --> 00:03:18.566
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

66
00:03:18.886 --> 00:03:20.067
The hat exploded.

67
00:03:20.087 --> 00:03:23.928
"No!" Viktor cried.

68
00:03:29.411 --> 00:03:32.492
After Roxy brought Viktor to jail, she returned to the fashion show.

69
00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:38.482
"That was amazing, Roxy!"

70
00:03:38.783 --> 00:03:39.544
Terrell whispered.

71
00:03:39.564 --> 00:03:41.566
"Sorry I couldn't help you."

72
00:03:42.447 --> 00:03:45.011
Roxy remembered Terrell's words again and smiled.

73
00:03:45.031 --> 00:03:48.595
"Actually, Terrell, you did help me!"
